}","gap":"no","margin":{"unit":"px","top":"80","right":0,"bottom":"0","left":0,"isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"5982849","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100,"align":"center"},"elements":[{"id":"d2dd37e","elType":"widget","settings":{"title":"Shop by Brand","title_color":"#ec8a22","align":"left","typography_typography":"custom","typography_font_size":{"unit":"px","size":42,"sizes":[]},"typography_text_transform":"uppercase","_border_border":"solid","_border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"01","left":"0","isLinked":false},"_border_color":"#d3d3d3","_element_width":"auto","header_size":"h1","_margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"0","bottom":"0","left":"0","isLinked":false},"__dynamic__":{"title":"[elementor-tag id="57bdcc2" name="page-title" settings="%7B%7D"]"}},"elements":[],"widgetType":"heading"}],"isInner":false}],"isInner":false},{"id":"74510e3","elType":"section","settings":{"margin":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":0,"bottom":"80","left":0,"isLinked":false}},"elements":[{"id":"81bc40a","elType":"column","settings":{"_column_size":100},"elements":[{"id":"0b730f7","elType":"widget","settings":{"tabs":[{"tab_title":"I don’t remember my password, what do I do?","tab_content":"<p>Click the <span style="text-decoration: underline;"><a href="/wp-login.php?action=lostpassword">Lost your password?</a></span> Link just under the Portal login box.</p>","_id":"17a042d"},{"tab_title":"How long does my order take to receive?","tab_content":"<p>Your order will generally take 10 days or less from the first business day following the placement of your order (i.e. You place your order on a Friday, the 10-day clock will start on Monday with Monday being the first day).</p>","_id":"fb2217c"},{"tab_title":"Can I purchase my items in store the same day?","tab_content":"<p>Yes, if the items are in stock at the store, you can purchase the same day except items requiring embroidery.  All transactions however, must still be rung through the Portal.  BareBones may have items that are for sizing only so we may also reserve those for fitting and then order from such fitting accordingly.</p>","_id":"0716961"},{"tab_title":"Can I backorder items?  If so, how long will backorders generally take?","tab_content":"<p>Yes, you can backorder items and generally will be shown the expected “back in stock” date for the particular item in the color/size you are looking for.  If the item has been discontinued or has a backorder date of over 3 months, an “Out of Stock” message may be displayed and the item may be prevented from being added to the cart.  (Exception to this are Dragonwear items that will allow for backorder despite backorder timeframe.  It is important that any SMUD employee who adds such items to the cart understands that backorder dates can be further delayed from this particular company.)</p>","_id":"5320640"},{"tab_title":"Does BareBones provide Hemming/Customizing/Repairs and how do I go about getting this done in the Portal?","tab_content":"<p>Yes, BareBones provides these services however we reserve the right to decline if the product will not hem well in the way requested, cannot be customized in the way requested, and/or the product is too worn or damage is too large to make a compliant repair.  Although rarely used, these services are free to SMUD employees.  In the Portal, you will just make a note upon checkout and state which items you would like altered.</p>","_id":"60f4058"},{"tab_title":"Can I return my items?  Even if they have the SMUD logo on them?","tab_content":"<p>BareBones definitely requests that you try on your items (or like items for fit) first as to not “waste” product in a returns process.  With that said, you can return any brand-new items even if they have the SMUD logo within 30 days of receiving date.  Items must be UNWASHED, SHOW NO SIGNS OF WEAR, AND BE IN PERFECTLY RESELLABLE CONDITION INCLUDING TAGS AND ORIGINAL PACKAGING.  The return may be declined if BareBones staff determines that the items cannot be resold to another SMUD employee as perfectly new.</p>","_id":"0dfd187"},{"tab_title":"It think my product may be defective, what do I do?","tab_content":"<p>Return your item to the nearest BareBones WorkWear location for evaluation and if determined the item is defected, you will receive credit on your allowance account within 3 business days.</p>","_id":"738dc23"},{"tab_title":"Will I be notified if there is a recall on any of the products that I have purchased","tab_content":"<p>Yes, if you purchased any product that has been recalled by the manufacturer, you and SMUD management will receive an email explaining what is being recalled and what actions to take</p>","_id":"f7a98d1"},{"tab_title":"Can I buy products not shown in the SMUD FR Apparel Portal?","tab_content":"<p>By contract, you will not be allowed to purchase any item using your SMUD funds that is not for purchase within the Portal.  This includes outside products from vendors who do have some product on the portal, plaids, or other non-approved items.  You may always purchase other BareBones merchandise using your own funds.</p>","_id":"660efdc"},{"tab_title":"How do I suggest a new product to add for the Portal?","tab_content":"<p>Please visit the Help Center for your contact for new product suggestions</p>","_id":"a5b3386"},{"tab_title":"What products will get the SMUD logo embroidered and where?","tab_content":"<p>All tops including shirts, jackets, and sweatshirts (except Dri-fire base layer shirts) will be embroidered with the SMUD logo per SMUD guidelines and usually on the left breast unless there is a high zipper or pocket preventing this and then it may be moved to the right breast.  On rare occasions (like when there is high visibility striping), the logo may be moved to the left shoulder/sleeve.</p>","_id":"48d7a51"},{"tab_title":"Can I bring in my own products to be embroidered?  Can I say where to embroider?","tab_content":"<p>If the product is on the accepted list displayed in the Portal, you may and BareBones will embroider at no charge per standard guidelines.  Special requests for placement will not be considered.  If the items being brought in are not in the Portal, BareBones will not embroider.  BareBones also reserves the right to not embroider if the item shows excessive wear/age.</p>","_id":"18b4e9e"},{"tab_title":"Will BareBones price match another retailer or website if I happen to find a better price?","tab_content":"<p>BareBones has contracted with SMUD for exact pricing so price matching will not be considered at this time.</p>","_id":"c59de94"},{"tab_title":"Will I still receive my SMUD discount of 12% on footwear?","tab_content":"<p>SMUD employees will still be allowed to receive a 12% discount up to two boot transactions within 12 months.</p>","_id":"4a341d4"},{"tab_title":"Will BareBones price match footwear?","tab_content":"<p>BareBones is committed to getting you the best price on footwear.  This means we will apply your 12% SMUD discount or match the price whichever is cheapest for you.  We <strong>won’t</strong> price match <strong>and then</strong> apply the 12% SMUD discount.</p>","_id":"61203c7"},{"tab_title":"Can I spend over my allotted amount?","tab_content":"<p>Yes, you can by using a personal credit card or PayPal</p>","_id":"071b3e1"},{"tab_title":"Are there size charts that will allow for better sizing when ordering online?","tab_content":"<p>Yes, there will be a link on the Product Detail page for the item you are interested in for most items.</p>","_id":"ae0b49f"},{"tab_title":"How will I be notified that my product has arrived at a store for pickup?","tab_content":"<p>You will receive a text message notifying you which product(s) have arrived for your order.  You may receive a phone call if there is a question on your order, you have not picked up your item(s) after an excessive amount of time, or there is any other communication in which text messages are not deemed appropriate by BareBones WorkWear staff. For Help Center, please replace the user manual with the one attached</p>","_id":"b9ba31c"},{"tab_title":"Who do I contact for technical issues with the website?","tab_content":"<p>Please contact Mason Moore at 916-287-9106 (smudhelp@barebonesworkwear.com) or BareBones – Rancho Cordova at 916-363-9327</p>","_id":"db0c3b9"}],"icon_active":"fa fa-caret-down","border_width":{"unit":"px","top":"","right":"","bottom":"","left":"","isLinked":true},"space_between":{"unit":"px","size":0,"sizes":[]},"title_color":"#0c0c0c","tab_active_color":"#0c0c0c","icon_color":"#a4243b","icon_active_color":"#ec8a22","content_color":"#000000","content_padding":{"unit":"px","top":"0","right":"15","bottom":"15","left":"15","isLinked":false},"_element_id":"faq","_css_classes":"faq-questions","custom_css":"selector#faq.faq-questions a{
    color: #A4243B;
}

selector#faq.faq-questions .elementor-active a{
